--- !u!1001 &4453021789158378961
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 5378693964919184788}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3475367355413045112, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'WELCOME TO MJOLNIR



        Welcome to Mjolnir Paper & Office Supplies AS.



        Your job is simple: handle company emails, help your coworkers,

        and keep the office running.



        Unfortunately, not every message in your inbox can be trusted.



        Spot the scams, complete the real work, and try to keep

        the Boss happy.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3475367355413045112, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 48.9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3475367355413045112, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4531706414739232020, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'GETTING STARTED



        Move with WASD and look around with the mouse.



        Use the Left Mouse Button to interact with objects

        and sit at a workstation.



        Check the sticky note in your cubicle for your current task.

        It will tell you when a coworker needs help.



        Start by checking your computer.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4531706414739232020, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5186594780654169119, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'LOOK BEFORE YOU CLICK



        Check the sender''s actual email address.

        Use the Directory to compare it with trusted contacts.



        Hover over the email''s action button to inspect

        where it really leads.



        Trust the message? Use its action button.

        Think it''s a scam? Choose REPORT SCAM and select the evidence.



        Made the wrong call? Review the feedback, learn from it,

        and get back to work.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5186594780654169119, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5765275491907430699, guid: a874d5fda46bc5e468ca4b5e547c30db, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalScale.y
